
<%- include('partials/header', { title: title }) %>

<section class="mb-4">
    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-3">
            <img
                src="/images/pfp.PNG"
                alt="Benjamin's profile picture"
                class="img-fluid rounded"
                style="max-width: 300px;"
            >
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-8">
            <p>
                Hello! My name is Benjamin, and I am a Networking and IT
                Security student at Ontario Tech University.
            </p>

            <p>
                I have been interested in technology and programming for
                many years. I started with simple block-based coding before
                moving on to Python and C# during high school.
            </p>

            <p>
                I have always been interested in understanding how computers
                work, how to build software, and how to protect systems
                from online threats.
            </p>

            <p>
                Ontario Tech University was my first choice for post-secondary
                education. I previously attended summer camps here, including
                coding, Minecraft, and LEGO robotics camps.
            </p>

            <p>
                My interest in networking and IT security comes from wanting
                to understand computer systems and develop skills in
                cybersecurity.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-4">
    <h2>Introduction Video</h2>

    <div class="text-center">
        <video controls class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%;">
            <source src="/videos/video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            <source src="/videos/video.ogv" type="video/ogg">

            Your browser does not support HTML video.
        </video>
    </div>
</section>

